<DocsLayout
  title="rubash — the embeddable GNU Bash 5.3-compatible engine"
  description="rubash product page: an embeddable bash engine written from scratch in Rust. crates.io 1.4.0 (cargo add rubash), zero-fork three-tier execution, full builtin coverage, the 83/83 GNU ledger, vendored-source methodology and the 1.5.0 embedding-API blueprint."
  path="/en/products/rubash/"
  lang="en"
  enPath="/products/rubash/"
  jsonLdExtra={productJsonLd}
  zhBanner
>
  <header class="doc-head">
    <h1>rubash</h1>
    <p class="lead">
      The embeddable GNU Bash 5.3-compatible engine: lexer, parser, expansion, execution and builtins
      all in-process, targeting byte-level compatibility with GNU Bash 5.3.0, native on Windows.
      <strong>rubash itself is not a shell product</strong> — it is the engine; the interactive product
      (niubash) is built on top of it.
    </p>
    <div class="badges">
      <span class="p-badge">Rust</span>
      <span class="p-badge">Windows · Linux · macOS</span>
      <span class="p-badge">beta · embedding API 1.5.0</span>
      <span class="p-badge">crates.io 1.4.0</span>
    </div>
    <p class="meta-line">
      <a href="https://github.com/unixwin/rubash" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">github.com/unixwin/rubash ↗</a>
      <span class="dot">·</span> Star 11
      <span class="dot">·</span> latest v1.4.0 (repo-meta, measured 2026-10-19)
    </p>
  </header>

  <section>
    <h2 id="why">Why rubash</h2>
    <p>
      Want to give an editor, test framework or agent host "a library that runs real bash scripts"?
      Until now there were two roads: link a ported bash with a POSIX emulation layer (an MIT project
      cannot swallow GPL plus msys-2.0.dll), or use a toy shell subset. rubash is the third road: an
      MIT-licensed, zero-emulation-layer engine whose semantic alignment is measured byte-for-byte
      against 83 GNU upstream corpora — installed as a dependency in your project, not as an
      emulation layer in your users' systems.
    </p>
    <details class="zh-fold">
      <summary>中文原文 · Chinese original（4 张卡片全文）</summary>
      <div lang="zh-CN">
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Rubash 本身不是 shell 产品</strong>——从零用 Rust 写的 GNU Bash 语义引擎：词法、解析、展开、执行、内建全部进程内、headless；交互式 shell 建在引擎之上：niubash 内嵌 rubash 承担全部 bash 语义。</li>
          <li><strong>为什么不是移植 bash</strong>——Git Bash/MSYS2 装的是骑在 msys-2.0.dll 上的移植 bash；rubash 没有这一层：一个自包含二进制直接说 Win32；GPL 代码零拷贝是成文红线。</li>
          <li><strong>兼容是台账，不是口号</strong>——83 套上游语料 true-baseline 双向测量：83/83 通过、82 套逐字节一致；modernish 166/166、bash-completion 452/452、oh-my-bash 252/252——全部钉成 CI 回归夹具。</li>
          <li><strong>语义模型平台中立</strong>——三层模型刻意与平台无关；Linux 原生构建并运行（WSL 内实测 19/24 套逐字节一致且在收敛），macOS CI 编译绿；Android 双目标进 CI 交叉检查。</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </details>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 id="features">Core features</h2>
    <p>
      62 real builtins with full GNU Bash 5.3 coverage; the zero-fork three-tier execution; 12 inlined
      file commands plus pipeline-inline arms; a selectable platform identity (MSYS-compatible persona
      vs honest native); an engineering surface for agents and debugging (function-level profiler,
      DAP-first debugger design); and a hard cross-platform CI gate. Full list (Chinese):
    </p>
    <details class="zh-fold">
      <summary>中文原文 · Chinese original（六条特性全文）</summary>
      <div lang="zh-CN">
        <ul>
          <li><strong>62 个真内建，全覆盖 GNU Bash 5.3</strong>——61 个内建全覆盖、无缺失，唯一扩展是 env；三层分发由仓内文档同步测试守护——改白名单不更新文档，cargo test 直接失败。</li>
          <li><strong>零 fork 的三层执行</strong>——（ list ）与 $( ) 从不产生进程；真句柄 fd 表以 DuplicateHandle 共享同一内核文件对象；真进程只在真进程边界。</li>
          <li><strong>12 个内联文件命令 + 管道内联臂</strong>——pwd、printf、mkdir、touch、chmod、cp、rm、rmdir、cat、sed、mkfifo、tty 引擎内联执行，echo | cat 这类管道一整个零 fork。</li>
          <li><strong>可选择的平台身份</strong>——Windows 默认 MSYS2 兼容 persona，RUBASH_IDENTITY=native 切到诚实原生身份；persona 在 --help、--identity 与 README 处处披露，永不静默。</li>
          <li><strong>为 agent 与调试准备的工程面</strong>——脚本级函数级 profiler（确定性插桩）已合并；DAP-first 调试器设计定稿；引擎跑得动 bashdb 核心调试循环。</li>
          <li><strong>跨平台 CI 硬门</strong>——ubuntu / macOS / Windows x64 三个真 runner，四目标交叉检查；单测 698 通过 / 0 失败；跨平台缺口有公开台账。</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </details>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 id="install">Install &amp; quick start</h2>
    <p>Embed as a dependency (the engine is a library; the org's three crates on crates.io — rubash, niubash, niubash-runtime — are all at 1.4.0):</p>
    <div class="cmd">
      <pre><code>{cargoAdd}</code></pre>
      <CopyButton copy={cargoAdd} label="Copy" title="Copy to clipboard" />
    </div>
    <p>Build the reference CLI from source:</p>
    <div class="cmd">
      <pre><code>{buildFromSource}</code></pre>
      <CopyButton copy={buildFromSource} label="Copy" title="Copy to clipboard" />
    </div>
    <p>Run a script (the reference CLI's usage — the entry shape of the compatibility harness):</p>
    <div class="cmd">
      <pre><code>{runScript}</code></pre>
      <CopyButton copy={runScript} label="Copy" title="Copy to clipboard" />
    </div>
    <p class="first-run">
      For a first encounter, run the compatibility suite directly:
      <code>MSYS_NO_PATHCONV=1 wsl bash scripts/true-baseline.sh</code> — the engine's catchphrase is
      "measured"; the benchmark scripts are part of the product.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 id="deep">Deep dive: embedding, execution model and the compatibility ledger</h2>
    <details class="zh-fold">
      <summary>中文原文 · Chinese original（嵌入 / 执行模型 / 兼容台账 三节全文）</summary>
      <div lang="zh-CN">
        <p><strong>嵌入方式与 1.5.0 蓝图</strong>：今天的 1.4.0 已经把引擎当依赖用——niubash 是第一个完整消费者，driver 级 API 已在生产。1.5.0 蓝图（RFC 已合并，PR rubash#814）：四层 workspace 拆分（rubash-core / rubash-driver / rubash-interactive / rubash facade）、Session 级稳定嵌入 API、846 处 env-IPC 形态逐族替换为 typed bridges。验收标准：外部编辑器能嵌入引擎而不需要知道 Windows 的存在。</p>
        <p><strong>三层执行模型</strong>：POSIX fork() 在 Win32 没有等价物；rubash 复刻 fork 的语义而非机制——进程内子壳复制变量与 fd 表、真句柄 fd 表实现 POSIX dup 语义、真进程只在真进程边界出现。细读见 <a href="/en/docs/execution-model/">执行模型：零 fork 三层</a>；性能见 <a href="/en/docs/performance-model/">性能特征</a>与 <a href="/en/benchmarks/">基准页</a>。</p>
        <p><strong>兼容台账与 vendored 源码方法论</strong>：语义判定的一手依据是仓内 vendored 的 GNU bash-5.3 源码（third_party/bash）：每个行为主张必须给 file:line 坐标；GPL 代码零拷贝红线成文于 docs/PROVENANCE.md；发布包不携带 third_party。台账见 <a href="/en/docs/compatibility/">兼容总览</a>；超出 GNU 套件的部分同样钉成 CI 夹具。</p>
      </div>
    </details>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 id="bench">Measured numbers</h2>
    <p>Every row is a real-machine, reproducible measurement; "N× faster" figures for array writes are against the previous engine, with the gap to GNU listed separately — wins and losses both shown.</p>
    <div class="table-scroll">
      <table class="cli-table">
        <thead>
          <tr><th>Metric</th><th>rubash</th><th>Framing / contrast</th><th>Source</th></tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
