    <p class="src-line">
      Latest entries from changelogs.json (the rubash repo's CHANGELOG.md); the full feed lives on the <a href="/en/changelog/">changelog</a>.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 id="links">Related links</h2>
    <h3>On this site</h3>
    <ul>
      <li><a href="/en/products/niubash/">niubash product page</a> — rubash's first complete host (the reference integration)</li>
      <li><a href="/en/docs/execution-model/">Execution model: three tiers, zero forks</a> · <a href="/en/docs/compatibility/">Compatibility: 83/83</a> · <a href="/en/docs/performance-model/">Performance profile</a></li>
      <li><a href="/en/benchmarks/">Benchmarks</a> (8/8 workloads all faster than Git Bash, same session) · <a href="/en/changelog/">Changelog</a></li>
    </ul>
    <h3>Off site</h3>
    <ul>
      <li><a href="https://github.com/unixwin/rubash" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub repo ↗</a> · <a href="https://github.com/unixwin/rubash/releases" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Releases ↗</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://crates.io/crates/rubash" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">crates.io/crates/rubash ↗</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://github.com/unixwin/rubash/blob/main/docs/design/1.5.0-workspace-and-engine-api.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">1.5.0 workspace &amp; embedding API design ↗</a> · <a href="https://github.com/unixwin/rubash/blob/main/docs/builtins.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Builtin roster (single source of truth) ↗</a> · <a href="https://github.com/unixwin/rubash/blob/main/docs/PROVENANCE.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">PROVENANCE ↗</a></li>
      <li><a href="/products/rubash/" hreflang="zh-CN" lang="zh-CN">Chinese edition of this page</a></li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</DocsLayout>

